---

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Citizen
  participant App as Mobile/Kiosk App
  participant Edge as Edge Cluster
  participant Policy as Policy Service
  participant Elig as Eligibility Service
  participant Kafka as Kafka Backbone
  participant Gov as Governance Dashboard

  Citizen->>App: Submit profile and intent
  App->>Edge: Offline sync and eligibility request
  Edge->>Policy: Use cached policy bundle
  Edge->>Elig: Execute deterministic rules
  Elig-->>Edge: Eligibility decision + explanation
  Edge-->>App: Show decision in citizen language
  Edge->>Kafka: Publish event when online
  Kafka->>Gov: Update aggregated insights
